<title>NETHERLANDS: SOCCER-DUTCH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-DUTCH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-09-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of Dutch first</p>
<p>division soccer played on Sunday:</p>
<p>Graafschap Doetinchem 2 (Ibrahim 47th, Viscaal 70th) PSV</p>
<p>Eindhoven 1 (Marcelo 78th). Halftime 0-0. Attendance not given.</p>
<p>Ajax Amsterdam 2 (Babangida 23rd, Litmanen 63rd) Sparta</p>
<p>Rotterdam 0. Halftime 1-0. Attendance 49,567.</p>
<p>Twente Enschede 0 Feyenoord Rotterdam 1 (Van Gastel 38th).</p>
<p>Halftime 0-1. Attendance 9,000.</p>
<p>Volendam 2 (De Bruijn 55th 69th) Willem II Tilburg 1 (Kolkka</p>
<p>14th). Halftime 0-1. Attendance 3,500.</p>
<p>Groningen 2 (Magno 44th, Gorre 51st) NEC Nijmegen 4 (Maes 9th,</p>
<p>Sumiala 17th, Koning 38th, Cruden 90th). Halftime 0-3.</p>
<p>Attendance 7,000.</p>
<p>RKC Waalwijk 0 Roda JC Kerkrade 2 (Van Houdt 36th, Sibon 45th).</p>
<p>Halftime 0-2. Attendance not given.</p>
<p>Played on Saturday:</p>
<p>NAC Breda 1 (MacDonald 60th) AZ Alkmaar 0. Halftime 0-0.</p>
<p>Attendance 11,458</p>
<p>Fortuna Sittard 1 (Hamming 30th) Utrecht 3 (Mols 29th 42nd,</p>
<p>Van Loen 32nd). Halftime 1-3. Attendance 4,000.</p>
<p>Played on Friday:</p>
<p>Vitesse Arnhem 1 (Van Wanrooy 8th) Heerenveen 1 (Talan 81st).</p>
<p>Halftime 1-0. Attendance 6,009.</p>
